  "description": "<p>Rothco's Carbon Fiber Hard Knuckle Cut/Fire Resistant Gloves offer superior hand protection for a range of tasks. Featuring molded carbon fiber inserts surrounded by textured genuine leather, these gloves provide maximum shielding and protection to the knuckles. Engineered with a durable and long-lasting material construction above the wrist and top side of fingers and thumb, these tough gloves are up to the task. Rothco&rsquo;s tactical gloves boast a smooth base layer and a textured top layer, offering a combination of comfort and grip. The neoprene adjustable hook and loop closure ensure a secure and proper fit, allowing you to focus on the task at hand without worrying about glove slippage. Whether you're in law enforcement, fire rescue, or engaged in outdoor activities, these gloves are designed to withstand the rigors of demanding environments. Trust Rothco's Carbon Fiber Hard Knuckle Cut/Fire Resistant Gloves to keep your hands protected in challenging situations.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
